<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-NZ BEAT FIJI 71-5 IN ONE-OFF TEST.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NZ BEAT FIJI 71-5 IN ONE-OFF TEST.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Fiji 71-5</p>
<p>(halftime 45-5) in a one-off rugby union test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New Zealand - Tries: C. Cullen (2), J. Wilson (5), M. Jones,</p>
<p>J. Marshall, T. Umaga, C. Riechelmann. Conversons: A. Mehrtens</p>
<p>(6), C. Cullen (2).</p>
<p>Fiji - Try: Fero Lasagavibau.</p>
</text>
